WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.301
What to carry forward.

2
00:00:01.581 --> 00:00:09.901
Use the API’s structured-output feature whenever a program consumes the result; it is the cheapest reliability win in this studio.

3
00:00:10.181 --> 00:00:19.760
Define the schema in Pydantic, check stop_reason before trusting the result, and keep validating in your own code, because providers enforce different subsets.

4
00:00:20.040 --> 00:00:22.899
Most of all, remember what you bought: valid shape.

5
00:00:23.179 --> 00:00:30.432
The values inside that shape are still model output, and the next lesson is about catching the ones that are confidently wrong.
